  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/NWigy0t.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"387\" height=\"244\"></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">製作膠水，塗抹在地面上，讓生物黏住。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">「黏膠」是一個小型模組，引入了一種新工具——膠水。它能讓玩家將膠水塗抹在地面上，藉此黏住生物。讓村民乖乖站在你想要的位置，不必再用方塊把他們圍起來。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/y7BFfah.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"999\" height=\"562\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:14px\">共有三種膠水：</span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>一般膠水</strong>：能將任何<strong>非攻擊性</strong>生物黏在地面上，直到你移除膠水或移動該生物。如果生物變得具有攻擊性，它們也會掙脫。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>隱形膠水</strong>：作用方式與一般膠水相同，但它的痕跡幾乎看不見。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>魔法膠水</strong>：只能在有限時間內生效，但可以黏住<strong>攻擊性</strong>生物。</span></li>\n</ul><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/LMQVrqg\" alt=\"\"></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/LMQVrqg.gifv\" alt=\"\"></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/LMQVrqg.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"1006\" height=\"566\"></span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">但請記住，<strong><span style=\"color:#008000\">烏龜</span> </strong>太過強大，無法被黏住。你應該尊重牠們，或者畏懼牠們。<span style=\"color:#008000\">烏龜萬歲！</span></span>.<img src=\"\" alt=\"\"></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>使用權限</strong></span></p><ul>\n<li><strong>你可以</strong>將此模組加入模組包（若能標註來源會非常感謝）。請注意，此模組尚未在伺服器上經過完整測試。</li>\n<li><strong>請勿在其他網站重新上傳此模組</strong>。請一律使用本頁面的連結。</li>\n</ul>",
